# 本仓库的包目录是 PhysicsWorld/，因此忽略规则都相对它书写。

# 原生构建产物与依赖缓存：由 PhysicsWorld/native/build.bat 生成，不进版本库。
PhysicsWorld/native/runtime/
PhysicsWorld/native/build/
PhysicsWorld/native/.fetch-cache/
PhysicsWorld/native/extern/JoltPhysics/
PhysicsWorld/native/extern/nanobind/

# Python 缓存
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# 测试与基准产物
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
junit*.xml

# 测试工程与备份：默认忽略所有 .blend，仅保留断裂测试用的夹具工程。
*.blend*
!PhysicsWorld/rigid/test/assets/jolt_fracture_user_project.blend
*~

# Unity oracle 的生成目录（工程源码保留，缓存与构建产物忽略）。
# 实测 Library/ 约 960 MB，且内含绝对路径，必须排除。
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/Library/
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/Logs/
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/Temp/
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/obj/
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/UserSettings/
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/Build/
PhysicsWorld/tools/mc2_unity_oracle/Builds/

# 备份与非关键产物
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
